<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="9a55b66"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e205e7ac">Governance processes are required to identify, manage, audit, and disseminate all information related to architecture
management, contracts, and implementation. These governance processes will be used to ensure that all architecture
artifacts and contracts, principles, and operational-level agreements are monitored on an ongoing basis with clear
auditability of all decisions made.</attribute>
